# Error Handling

- Raise/throw explicit errors; never silently swallow failures
- Use specific error types and actionable messages
- No catch-all handlers that hide root causes
- Do not add fallback flows that mask real issues
- Surface exact failure context during debugging
- Fix root causes, not symptoms

## API
- Return proper HTTP codes (2xx/4xx/5xx) with typed JSON bodies
- Validate and sanitize input early; short-circuit on invalid input
